From: Alexandros Mandravillis <Alexbeav@live.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 19:30:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] add cooperative guest checkpoint boundary

shiftglue port: the checkpoint include moves to pch_h.inja (shiftglue's
home for the former init_h.inja SDK block); xthread.cpp keeps
shiftglue's setjmp-based reentry instead of ReenterException.
